. 
. *******************************************************************************
. ****************************** VI-EF & VI-RE **********************************
. *******************************************************************************
. /*
> TALLER: RE-IV (Wooldridge 11.2) con "airfare" 
> 
> Modelo:
>   lpassen_it = b1*ldist_it + b2*ldistsq_it + b3*lfare_it + c_i + u_it
>   lfare_it endógena
>   Instrumento excluido: concern_it
>   Exógenas: ldist_it, ldistsq_it (también son instrumentos)
> */
. 
. 
. clear all

. set more off

. 
. bcuse airfare, clear

Contains data from http://fmwww.bc.edu/ec-p/data/wooldridge/airfare.dta
 Observations:         4,596                  
    Variables:            16                  24 Jan 2013 11:00
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Variable      Storage   Display    Value
